;; Session fixture (docs/incremental.md B1): two independent components in
;; one program -- edge/path and color/bright.  A batch into edge must
;; re-enter ONLY path's stratum (cone(edge) excludes bright); the test
;; counts re-run strata and checks bright is untouched.

table (edge int int)
table (path int int)
table (color int)
table (bright int)

rule (edge 1 2) (edge 2 3)
rule (color 7)

rule (edge X Y) --> (path X Y)
rule (path X Y) (edge Y Z) --> (path X Z)

rule (color X) --> (bright X)
